  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "xby-who-is",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 的插件：WHOIS查询服务\n\n一个基于Model Context Protocol (MCP)的WHOIS域名查询服务器，支持877+顶级域名和169个国家代码顶级域名的解析，提供全面的域名注册信息查询功能。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- **set_xby_apikey** — 在聊天中设置 API 密钥（自动持久化，重启有效）\n- **whois_lookup** — Look up domain information using WHOIS protocol (port 43). Queries authoritative WHOIS servers for domain registration details including registrar, registrant, dates, nameservers, and status. Supports 1,260+ TLDs.\n- **refresh_whois_servers** — Refresh the WHOIS server dictionary by fetching the latest TLD list from IANA. This updates the list of available WHOIS servers for domain lookups. Run this periodically to ensure the server list is up-to-date.\n- **list_supported_tlds** — List all supported TLDs (Top-Level Domains) that have WHOIS servers available. Returns the complete list of TLDs that can be queried."
    },
    {
      "section": "方式一：从 GitHub 直接安装（推荐）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "格式: dsh plugin --profile <profile> add github:<owner>/<repo>",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add github:xby_skill/xby-who-is\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式二：从本地目录安装（开发模式）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "仅用于本地开发调试",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add /absolute/path/to/xby-who-is\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式三：通过 cordis.patch.yml 开发调试",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh web --profile web --patch /absolute/path/to/dsh-ocr-plugin/cordis.patch.yml\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "获取 API 密钥",
      "text": "前往 [小笨羊官网](https://xiaobenyang.com) 注册并获取 API 密钥。"
    }
  ],
